## POSTGRESQL ROW LEVEL SECURITY (RLS)

### Setup Complet RLS

#### 1. Activer RLS sur toutes les tables
```sql
-- Execute sur CHAQUE table tenant-scoped
ALTER TABLE analyses ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
ALTER TABLE competitors ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
ALTER TABLE watchlists ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
ALTER TABLE reports ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
ALTER TABLE alerts ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
ALTER TABLE rag_documents ENABLE ROW LEVEL SECURITY;
```

#### 2. Fonction Tenant Context
```sql
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION current_tenant_id()
RETURNS uuid
LANGUAGE plpgsql
STABLE
SECURITY DEFINER
AS $$
BEGIN
  RETURN NULLIF(current_setting('app.current_tenant', true), '')::uuid;
END;
$$;

-- Fonction admin bypass
CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION is_admin()
RETURNS boolean
LANGUAGE plpgsql
STABLE
AS $$
BEGIN
  RETURN COALESCE(current_setting('app.is_admin', true)::boolean, false);
END;
$$;
```

#### 3. Policies Standard
```sql
-- SELECT: lire ses propres donnees
CREATE POLICY tenant_select ON analyses
  FOR SELECT
  USING (tenant_id = current_tenant_id() OR is_admin());

-- INSERT: inserer pour son tenant
CREATE POLICY tenant_insert ON analyses
  FOR INSERT
  WITH CHECK (tenant_id = current_tenant_id());

-- UPDATE: modifier ses propres donnees
CREATE POLICY tenant_update ON analyses
  FOR UPDATE
  USING (tenant_id = current_tenant_id())
  WITH CHECK (tenant_id = current_tenant_id());

-- DELETE: supprimer ses propres donnees
CREATE POLICY tenant_delete ON analyses
  FOR DELETE
  USING (tenant_id = current_tenant_id());
```

### Tenant Context dans n8n
```javascript
// Option 1: SET au niveau session
const setTenantContext = async (tenantId) => {
  await $db.execute(`SET app.current_tenant = '${tenantId}'`);
};

// Option 2: SET LOCAL dans transaction (RECOMMANDE)
const withTenantContext = async (tenantId, callback) => {
  await $db.execute('BEGIN');
  await $db.execute(`SET LOCAL app.current_tenant = '${tenantId}'`);

  try {
    const result = await callback();
    await $db.execute('COMMIT');
    return result;
  } catch (error) {
    await $db.execute('ROLLBACK');
    throw error;
  }
};

// Usage
const results = await withTenantContext(tenantId, async () => {
  return await $db.execute('SELECT * FROM analyses ORDER BY created_at DESC LIMIT 10');
});
```

### Safe Join Patterns
```sql
-- TOUJOURS verifier tenant_id dans les JOINs
SELECT
  a.id,
  a.title,
  a.summary,
  c.name as competitor_name,
  w.name as watchlist_name
FROM analyses a
JOIN competitors c ON c.id = a.competitor_id
  AND c.tenant_id = a.tenant_id  -- CRITICAL: prevent cross-tenant
JOIN watchlists w ON w.id = c.watchlist_id
  AND w.tenant_id = a.tenant_id  -- CRITICAL
WHERE a.tenant_id = $1
  AND a.created_at > NOW() - INTERVAL '30 days'
ORDER BY a.created_at DESC;

-- JAMAIS joindre sans verification tenant
-- BAD: JOIN competitors c ON c.id = a.competitor_id
```

