## N8N WORKFLOW STANDARDS

### Naming Convention
```
[DOMAIN]-[ACTION]-[VERSION]
Examples:
- ANALYSIS-COMPETITOR-CREATE-V1.0
- DASHBOARD-METRICS-AGGREGATE-V2.0
- ALERT-THRESHOLD-CHECK-V1.1
- RAG-DOCUMENT-INGEST-V1.0
```

### Node Naming
```
[Number]_[Action]_[Target]
Examples:
- 01_validate_input
- 02_auth_check
- 03_fetch_competitor
- 04_call_claude
- 05_extract_structured
- 06_persist_results
- 07_format_response
- ERR_handle_error
```

### Structured Output Extraction (Claude)
```javascript
// Information Extractor Node configuration
{
  "schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "summary": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Executive summary in 2-3 sentences"
      },
      "keyFindings": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": { "type": "string" },
        "maxItems": 5,
        "description": "Top 5 key findings"
      },
      "recommendations": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "object",
          "properties": {
            "action": { "type": "string" },
            "priority": { "type": "string", "enum": ["high", "medium", "low"] },
            "impact": { "type": "string" }
          }
        },
        "maxItems": 3
      },
      "threatLevel": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": ["LOW", "MEDIUM", "HIGH", "CRITICAL"]
      },
      "confidenceScore": {
        "type": "number",
        "minimum": 0,
        "maximum": 100
      },
      "dataQuality": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "completeness": { "type": "number" },
          "freshness": { "type": "string" },
          "reliability": { "type": "number" }
        }
      }
    },
    "required": ["summary", "keyFindings", "threatLevel", "confidenceScore"]
  }
}
```

